WEBVTT

00:00:01.714 --> 00:00:02.332
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.381 --> 00:00:07.551
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Doctors are very <b>clear</b> – smoking is a bad idea.

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:10.165
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.196 --> 00:00:14.337
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> You’ll feel much <b>better</b> if you wear a warm sweater.

00:00:16.359 --> 00:00:17.000
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.056 --> 00:00:22.855
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Do your make-up, do your <b>hair</b>, and buy some nice new clothes to wear.

00:00:24.879 --> 00:00:25.537
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:26.546 --> 00:00:29.929
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Things aren’t always as they <b>seem</b> when you see them in a dream.